text:
Received a phone call from Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu. We reviewed the sustained momentum in our bilateral ties and reaffirmed our commitment to further strengthening our partnership.

We also exchanged views on recent developments in West Asia and underscored the urgent need to restore peace and stability in the region.

@netanyahu

Greetings to the personnel of the National Security Guard on their Raising Day.

They embody courage, precision and an unwavering commitment to duty. Their steadfast vigil against terrorism and their readiness to protect our people and vital national assets inspire immense confidence and pride.

@nsgblackcats

Pleased to meet Canadian Foreign Minister Anita Anand. We had a productive discussion on further strengthening India-Canada ties in trade, technology, security, energy, education and people-to-people exchanges.

India is committed to building a constructive and forward-looking strategic partnership with Canada that delivers tangible benefits to the people of both countries.

@AnitaAnandMP

Happy to learn that His Holiness Pope Leo XIV’s surgery last night was successful.

Wishing him a full and speedy recovery as well as continued good health.

@Pontifex

Thank you, Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed Ali, for your warm wishes. I also extend my congratulations and best wishes on your assumption of office for another term.

I fondly recall my visit to Ethiopia last December and our recent meeting in New Delhi. India greatly values its Strategic Partnership with Ethiopia and I look forward to working closely with you to further deepen our cooperation and friendship.

@AbiyAhmedAli

Thank you, President Hichilema, for your warm wishes. 

India deeply values its friendship with Zambia and I look forward to further strengthening our close partnership.

@HHichilema

My gratitude to former President Shri Ram Nath Kovind Ji for the greetings and kind words. 

His observations about the changes taking place across India, particularly in the lives of the poor and the marginalised, are especially meaningful to me. Whatever has been achieved belongs to the collective resolve of 140 crore Indians.

@ramnathkovind

గత కొన్ని రోజులుగా ఆంధ్రప్రదేశ్‌కు చెందిన ప్రజలు తిరుపతి నుంచి కాశీ వరకు బైక్ యాత్రను చేపట్టారు. సేవ, సుపరిపాలన (సుశాసన్)కు ప్రాధాన్యతనిస్తూ ఈ యాత్రను నిర్వహించారు. కృష్ణా, గోదావరి నదుల పవిత్ర జలాలను కాశీకి తీసుకువెళ్లడం లాంటివి హృదయానుభూతిని కలిగించింది.

అన్ని వర్గాల ప్రజలు పాల్గొనేలా ఈ యాత్రను నిర్వహించిన టీడీపీ నాయకులు, కార్యకర్తల బృందాన్ని నేను అభినందిస్తున్నాను.

@JaiTDP 

@ncbn 

@naralokesh

Over the last few days, people from Andhra Pradesh embarked on a bike Yatra from Tirupati to Kashi, emphasising Seva and good governance (Sushasan). Their gesture of carrying sacred waters from the Krishna and Godavari rivers to Kashi is also very touching. 

I compliment the team of TDP leaders and Karyakartas who organised the Yatra and ensured people from all walks of life participated. 

@JaiTDP 

@ncbn 

@naralokesh

I deeply appreciate your warm wishes, President Duma Boko. 

India greatly values the friendship with Botswana and I look forward to working together to further strengthen our close ties.

@duma_boko

Thank you, Prime Minister Tobgay, for the warm and heartfelt message.

India and Bhutan are bound by an enduring partnership rooted in mutual trust and understanding. I look forward to continuing our close cooperation to advance our shared vision of Viksit Bharat and a prosperous Bhutan.

@tsheringtobgay

Thank you, President Ferdinand Marcos Jr., for your wishes. 

India deeply values its Strategic Partnership with the Philippines. I look forward to our continued engagement and further deepening of the friendship between our nations. 

@bongbongmarcos

Thank you, Prime Minister Bart De Wever, for your wonderful wishes. 

I look forward to working with you to build on the positive momentum in our relations and further strengthen our bilateral partnership.

@Bart_DeWever

Thank you, President Tinubu. 

India and Nigeria are close partners and leading voices of the Global South. I look forward to continuing our cooperation to further strengthen our Strategic Partnership and advance our shared vision for a more inclusive, prosperous and peaceful world.

@NGRPresident
